          "content": "🔍 Found 3 result(s) for 'genomic prediction model definition genomic selection':\n\n## Genomic Selection in Plant and Animal Breeding Guide - CD Genomics\n**URL:** https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/resource-genomic-selection-plant-animal-breeding.html\n\nGenomic Selection in Plant and Animal Breeding Guide - CD Genomics\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[![CD Genomics Agrigenome Logo](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/wp-content/themes/agrigenome/images/logo.svg)](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/)\n\n* [Home](/agri/)\n* [Services](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/services.html)\n  + [Sequencing Services](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/sequencing-services.html)\n    - [Agricultural NGS Services](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/agricultural-ngs-technologies-and-services.html)\n      * [Plant & Animal WGS](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/animal-and-plant-whole-genome-sequencing.html)\n      * [Whole Genome Resequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/whole-genome-resequencing.html)\n      * [RRGS](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/reduced-representation-genome-sequencing-rrgs.html)\n      * [Targeted Sequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/targeted-sequencing.html)\n      * [Exome Sequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/exome-sequencing.html)\n      * [Animal and Plant De Novo Sequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/animal-and-plant-de-novo-sequencing.html)\n      * [cpDNA Sequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/chloroplast-dna-cpdna-sequencing.html)\n      * [Plant & Animal mtDNA Sequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/plant-and-animal-mitochondrial-sequencing.html)\n      * [Transcriptome (RNA-seq) Services](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/transcriptome-rna-seq-services.html)\n      * [Small RNA-seq](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/small-rna-sequencing.html)\n      * [Epigenetic Sequencing](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/epigenetic-sequencing.html)\n      * [ChIP-seq](https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/chip-seq-services.html)\n  