eliance on costly progeny testing and increased rates of genetic gain — and has since spread across crops and other livestock species [1].\n\n### Sources\n[1] Genomic Selection in Plant and Animal Breeding: Principles, Models, and Real-World Applications (CD Genomics): https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/resource-genomic-se",
