 in Plant and Animal Breeding: Principles, Models, and Real-World Applications (CD Genomics): https://www.cd-genomics.com/agri/resource-genomic-selection-plant-animal-breeding.html\n[2] Polygenic Risk Score (PRS) — NHGRI Talking Glossary"
